    "title": "terminal::row",
    "meta": "crates/rhc/src/bin/rhc/terminal.rs:90-107",
    "why": "一行狀態文字，外加一個 ok 旗標給 whoami 決定 exit code。",
    "start": 90,
    "hi": [
      92,
      103,
      104,
